  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Dont tell me**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Comfort**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Callin'**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **One of Those Days**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Feel Like Making Love**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2007-07-15.aud.flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 10 songs; 65 min [1]\n- **soulive2007-07-15.flac16**: source not stated; 10 songs; 66 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A passing storm cut the first song of the set short, causing a brief intermission [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2007-07-15.aud.flac16**: taped by Steve Baker; transferred by Zappafan2; source: FOB Sennheiser MKE2's>Sony PCM-M1 DAT [1]. Also: Transfer chain: Fostex D5 DAT playback to HHB CD-R830, extracted with EAC, edited in Audacity at 16-bit/44.1kHz, encoded to FLAC [1]\n- **soulive2007-07-15.flac16**: taped by Ed Guidry; transferred by Ed Guidry; source: (FOB/DFC) Neumann U89i (card, DIN, -80h)> Grace Design Lunatec V2> Apogee Minime> Tascam HD-P2 (16/44.1) on a Sandisc Ultra II 4gb CF card. [2]",
